<div id="urduTextPath">محرم ۱-۲-۳/مسافروں کی مدینے میں جب رسید آئی</div>
<p>musafero'n ki madine me jab raseed aayi<br />
ke waadagaah me fouj-e-shahe saeed aayi<br />
raseed aate hi sughra ke ghar me eid aayi<br />
tap-e- kohan gayi aur taaqate jadeed aayi</p>

<p>malaal door huwa aish ke qareene se<br />
buqaar nabz se, gham dil se, dard seene se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gharaz ke hazrate ummul banee'n ko bulwaaya<br />
wo aayi to sare tasleem uth ke nyodaaya<br />
wo has ke boli ke kyu yaad mujh ko farmaya<br />
kaha mareez ne qush ho ke sheh ka khat aaya</p>

<p>hamare dil ko faqat naamabar ne chain diya<br />
mohammade hanafi ko qate hussain diya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kahke madar-e- abbas ko liya hamraah<br />
mohammed-e- hanafi ke ghar aayi duqtar-e- shaah<br />
wo muntazar the liye naama-e shah-e zeejah<br />
salaam karte hi kahne lagi ba naala o aah</p>

<p>lo ab sunaao imam-e- ghareeb ka naama<br />
padho mareez ke aage tabeeb ka naama<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mohammed-e hanafi ne kiya lifafe ko wa<br />
nikala shuqae purnoor syed-ush shohdaa<br />
padha jo naame me alqaab apna roke kaha<br />
hussain tere karam par mai laakh jaa'n se fidaa</p>

<p>kahaa'n main tera baradar baja'n baraabar hoo'n<br />
tu jaane qatme rasul hai, main ibn-e- hyder hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aqi ka lafz jo alqaab me mere likkha<br />
faqat ye banda nawazi hai ya imam-e- huda<br />
tera ghulam hai abbas, mai ghulam uska<br />
hazaar haif qadam se huzoor ke hoo'n juda</p>

<p>liya jo naam-e- judayi to aansu bahne lage<br />
salaam padh ke alaikas salaam kahne lage<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kaha ye fatima sughra se tab ba deeda -e- tar<br />
likha hai baap ne tum ko ke aye meri duqtar<br />
dua ke baad ho maloom meri noor-e- nazar<br />
koi ghadi nahi ghafil teri taraf se pidar</p>

<p>qalaq hai sadma hai, ranj-o malaal hai sughra<br />
adu ke narghe me zehra ka laal hai sughra<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wafoor-e- fikr se sughra jo saqt ghabraayi<br />
chacha ka apne qalamdaan wo utha laayi<br />
aur iltemaas kiya aye hussain ke bhaai<br />
mujhe to hai naatawaanaai aur naabeenai</p>

<p>meri taraf se wo alqaab likho baba ko<br />
kanize'n likhti hai jis tarha apne aaqa ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghareeb parwar-o-aalam nawaaz-o qalq-e-khuda<br />
malak sipaahe falak bargah-e- shahinshah<br />
imam bekas-o mazloom o be dayaar-o tabaah<br />
qaleel kaaba-e- dee'n yousuf-e- rasoolallah</p>

<p>ajal rasidou ke eesa, gharibou'n ke waali<br />
hussain ibn-e- ali mudde zillahul aali<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pas az shuroote qadam bousi baad taslimaat<br />
likho zabanie sughra ke aye shahe qush zaat<br />
main tum se choot ke jaa'n kanii me hoon din raat<br />
na aarzu-e- shifa hai, na ab umeede- hayaat</p>

<p>nahi kisi ko tawaqqo ke ab teher jaaun<br />
tum aake sura-e yaseen padho to marjaaun<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rajab ki teesri ko tum ne ghar kiya veera'n<br />
tumhare baad huwi teen eide'n baba jaa'n<br />
shab-e barat huwi doosre mahine ayaa'n<br />
barooh-e hamza na thi fateha ki taab-o- tawaa'n</p>

<p>tamaam aah tadapte tadapte raat huwi<br />
hamare ghar me na eid-e- shabe baraat huwi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo eid to gayi din eid-e- fitr ka aaya<br />
ghar aankar mujhe hamjoliyou ne rulwaya<br />
kisi ne gehna, kisi ne libaas dikhlaya<br />
koi ye boli ke eidi me ham ne ye paaya</p>

<p>har ek qush tha magar mere lab pa naale the<br />
safar me sab meri eidi ke dene wale the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nazar me phirta hai eide guzishta ka aana<br />
wo eidgaah me akbar ka dhoom se jaana<br />
bahan ke waaste mewe qarid kar lana<br />
wo amma bano ka har dam gale se liptaana</p>

<p>bajabr ab to baghal geer jis se hoti hoo'n<br />
bahan sakina ko main yaad karke roti hoo'n<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>